僕の考えを当ててご覧よ
Try and guess what I'm thinking.

139
00:18:14,146 --> 00:18:21,646
些細な仕草 視線 瞬き 君はもう手のひらに
A slight gesture, a glance, a blink—you're already in the palm of my hand.

140
