みんな「めろぞーま」になる準備はいいかー？
Is everyone ready to become 'Melozoma'?

644
00:52:35,168 --> 00:52:42,168
めろぞーま、みんなコメントの準備もちょっとしといてほしいな。
Everyone, please get your comments ready for Melozoma too.

645
00:52:42,168 --> 00:52:47,668
そしてラストは魔導ゴンドラに乗ってお別れでーす！
And for the grand finale, we'll say goodbye from the magical gondola!

646
00:52:47,668 --> 00:52:51,168
何だ魔導ゴンドラって？みんな準備いいですかー？
What's a magical gondola? Is everyone ready?

647
00:52:51,168 --> 00:52:56,668
みんなめろぞーま準備して！めろぞーま！
Get ready for Melozoma, everyone! Melozoma!

648
00:52:56,668 --> 00:53:02,668
じゃあこれはめろぞーまも極大魔法か？でかそうだよね！
So is Melozoma some kind of grand magic spell? It sounds huge!

649
00:53:02,668 --> 00:53:11,168
上からゴンドラが降りてくるので、みんなで一緒に「めろぞーま」って打ってね！
The gondola is coming down from above, so everyone type 'Melozoma'!

650
00:53:11,168 --> 00:53:15,168
オッケー！じゃあ行くぞ！せーの！
Okay! Here we go! One, two...

651
00:53:15,168 --> 00:53:22,168
めろぞーまー！
Melozoma!

652
00:53:22,168 --> 00:53:29,668
来たー！上から！
Here it comes! From above!

653
00:53:29,668 --> 00:53:34,168
来ましたー！これ乗れる？乗れますかね？
It's here! Can we get on? Can we board it?

654
00:53:34,168 --> 00:53:39,668
乗れますか？ついてきてくださーい！
Shall we get on? Please follow us!

655
00:53:39,668 --> 00:53:45,168
じゃあね皆さん、最後まで盛り上がっていきましょう！
Alright everyone, let me hear you get hyped until the end!

656
00:53:45,168 --> 00:53:52,168
皆聴いてください！せーの！めろぞーま！
Everyone, please listen! One, two... Melozoma!

657
00:53:57,668 --> 00:54:00,168
とろけちゃってらびゅ ずっとずっと
Melting with love, forever and ever,

658
00:54:00,168 --> 00:54:04,668
頭の中ハートいっぱいになって ほらもっともっと
My head is full of hearts, look, more and more,

659
00:54:04,668 --> 00:54:11,168
釘付けになれ めろぞーまっ
Stay spellbound, Melozoma!

660
00:54:11,168 --> 00:54:16,668
Ever lasting love me...

661
00:54:16,668 --> 00:54:22,668
Ever lasting love you...

662
00:54:22,668 --> 00:54:28,668
女の子は魔法使い 神様がくれたプレゼント
Girls are spellcasters, a present given by God.

663
00:54:28,668 --> 00:54:35,168
恋しちゃったりだって 思わせぶりだって 必然的 outcome
Falling in love or playing hard to get is an inevitable outcome!

664
00:54:35,168 --> 00:54:42,168
甘い酸っぱいほろ苦い カラフルなポーション使い分けて
Sweet, sour, bittersweet, using colorful potions wisely,

665
00:54:42,168 --> 00:54:47,668
キミにかけたい呪文呟くの
I whisper the spell I want to cast on you.

666
00:54:47,668 --> 00:54:51,168
なんて恥ずかしい妄想が
What embarrassing delusions

667
00:54:51,168 --> 00:54:54,968
胸の中を駆け巡る ギルティ！
run wild through my heart, guilty!

668
00:54:54,968 --> 00:54:58,168
だってそばにいてほしいから
Because I want you by my side,

669
00:54:58,168 --> 00:55:00,168
メロがる呪文... めろぞーまっ
The spell that mesmerizes... Melozoma!

670
00:55:01,316 --> 00:55:02,516
とろけちゃって
Melting away,

671
00:55:02,516 --> 00:55:03,316
Love you

672
00:55:03,316 --> 00:55:04,416
ずっと ずっと
forever and ever,

673
00:55:04,416 --> 00:55:06,316
頭の中ハートいっぱいになって
my head is completely filled with hearts.

674
00:55:06,316 --> 00:55:08,316
ほら もっともっと
Look, more and more,

675
00:55:08,316 --> 00:55:10,316
釘付けになれ
become spellbound—

676
00:55:10,316 --> 00:55:13,916
めろぞーま
Melo-Zoma!

677
00:55:14,716 --> 00:55:19,216
Everlasting love me...

678
00:55:19,716 --> 00:55:25,216
Everlasting love you...

679
00:55:25,716 --> 00:55:28,716
レディファーストってなんかいや
I kind of hate "ladies first,"

680
00:55:28,716 --> 00:55:32,016
私ファーストが絶対です
"me first" is an absolute must!

681
00:55:32,016 --> 00:55:33,616
優しさも ぬくもりも
Kindness, warmth,

682
00:55:33,616 --> 00:55:35,016
時間も 感情だって
time, and even emotions—

683
00:55:35,016 --> 00:55:37,716
独占させて Fall in love...
let me monopolize them all and fall in love...

684
00:55:37,716 --> 00:55:40,416
カラフルだけどトゲあって
Colorful, yet with prickly thorns,

685
00:55:40,416 --> 00:55:43,016
こんぺいとうみたいな
like konpeito candy,

686
00:55:43,016 --> 00:55:45,416
この純情を
this pure devotion of mine,

687
00:55:45,416 --> 00:55:47,716
食べて欲しいな
I want you to eat it up.

688
00:55:47,716 --> 00:55:50,216
ほら、あーん、口あけて
Here, say "ah," open your mouth!

689
00:55:50,216 --> 00:55:53,716
まーただ、おかしな思考回路が
Well, my strange train of thought

690
00:55:53,716 --> 00:55:57,216
自律神経バグらすギルティ！
is glitching my nervous system—guilty!

691
00:55:57,216 --> 00:56:01,016
こんな気持ちはじめてなんだもん...
I've never felt like this before...

692
00:56:01,016 --> 00:56:03,716
わけもわからずに めろぞーま
Without even knowing why... Melo-Zoma!

693
00:56:03,716 --> 00:56:05,216
とろけちゃって
Melting away,

694
00:56:05,216 --> 00:56:06,216
Love you

695
00:56:06,216 --> 00:56:07,216
ずっと ずっと
forever and ever,

696
00:56:07,216 --> 00:56:08,716
両目見つめ
staring into both your eyes,

697
00:56:08,716 --> 00:56:10,216
ハートいっぱいになって
my heart is filled to the brim.

698
00:56:10,216 --> 00:56:12,216
ほら もっともっと
Look, more and more,

699
00:56:12,216 --> 00:56:16,416
溺れてしまえ めろぞーま
drown in it—Melo-Zoma!

700
00:56:16,416 --> 00:56:20,016
この魔法が絶対解けないように...
So this magic will never break...

701
00:56:20,016 --> 00:56:23,016
呪いと同じ類かもしれないけど...
It might be something like a curse, but...

702
00:56:23,016 --> 00:56:26,216
キミといつまでもとろけていたいから...
Because I want to stay melted together with you forever...

703
00:56:26,216 --> 00:56:29,216
ありったけの魔力を込めて...
Pouring in all the magic power I have...

704
00:56:29,216 --> 00:56:32,216
キミと出会った瞬間から始まった
Starting from the moment I met you,

705
00:56:32,216 --> 00:56:34,416
このロマンスが
this romance...

706
00:56:34,416 --> 00:56:37,716
ソーダみたいに弾けるなんて辛いよ
It's so painful for it to pop like soda bubbles.

707
00:56:37,716 --> 00:56:40,216
永遠になんて
Something like "forever"

708
00:56:40,216 --> 00:56:42,016
空想だけど
is just a fantasy,

709
00:56:42,016 --> 00:56:48,016
だけど願いたいのお
but I still want to wish for it!

710
00:56:48,016 --> 00:56:51,216
そんな魔法があればいいのに...
I wish a magic like that existed...

711
00:56:51,216 --> 00:56:54,216
切ないけど
It's bittersweet, but...

712
00:56:54,216 --> 00:56:56,416
素直になりたい
I want to be honest—

713
00:56:56,416 --> 00:56:57,716
めろぞーま
Melo-Zoma!

714
00:56:57,716 --> 00:56:59,416
唱えたいな
I want to chant,

715
00:56:59,416 --> 00:57:00,716
Love you

716
00:57:00,716 --> 00:57:02,416
ずっと ずっと
forever and ever...

717
00:57:02,416 --> 00:57:05,016
こんなにもキミに恋してるから
Because I'm so deeply in love with you,

718
00:57:05,016 --> 00:57:06,716
離れたくない
I don't want to be apart.

719
00:57:06,716 --> 00:57:08,216
Hug you

720
00:57:08,216 --> 00:57:09,416
もっともっと
more and more,

721
00:57:09,416 --> 00:57:10,716
想い愛したい
I want us to love each other—

722
00:57:10,716 --> 00:57:13,016
めろぞーま
Melo-Zoma!

723
00:57:13,016 --> 00:57:14,416
とろけちゃって
Melting away,

724
00:57:14,416 --> 00:57:15,416
Love you

725
00:57:15,416 --> 00:57:16,416
ずっと ずっと
forever and ever,

726
00:57:16,416 --> 00:57:18,216
頭の中ハート充満になって
my head is completely filled with hearts.

727
00:57:18,216 --> 00:57:20,016
ほら もっともっと
Look, more and more,

728
00:57:20,016 --> 00:57:22,416
釘付けになれ
become spellbound—

729
00:57:22,416 --> 00:57:25,016
めろぞーま
Melo-Zoma!

730
00:57:25,016 --> 00:57:27,716
解けないで とっておきの魔法
Don't break, my special magic!

731
00:57:27,716 --> 00:57:30,016
クラクラさせてやる メルティ
I'll make your head spin, melty!

732
00:57:30,016 --> 00:57:32,716
いつまでも私だけみてて
Keep looking only at me forever,

733
00:57:32,716 --> 00:57:35,416
唱える めろぞーま
as I chant Melo-Zoma!

734
00:57:35,416 --> 00:57:38,216
解かないで とっておきの呪文
Don't undo my special spell!

735
00:57:38,216 --> 00:57:40,416
ドキドキしてたいの メルシィ
I want to keep feeling my heart pound, merci!

736
00:57:40,416 --> 00:57:43,216
いつまでも私を愛してね
Love me forever and ever,

737
00:57:43,216 --> 00:57:46,016
唱える めろぞーま
as I chant Melo-Zoma!

738
00:57:46,016 --> 00:57:47,716
イチコロね
You're completely smitten,

739
00:57:47,716 --> 00:57:51,216
めろぞーま
Melo-Zoma!

